      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Blackfang108 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Tell that to my wallet.&nbsp; (I... may have an RPG purchasing problem)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYeah, me too admittedly, I just love reading RPG sourcebooks for fun. :3Still, as MindWanderer notes, it takes a lot of books to add up to the same price point. And certainly the bare minimum for playing a game is usually much smaller.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Indeed.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Now if only I could stop throwing money for Torg Eternity…</p>",
