      "created_at": "2018-03-29T20:33:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got a 10\" Kindle Fire, on Black Friday sale, for the purpose of reading rulebooks and comic books.&nbsp; Had to sideload Moon Reader+ (the Kindle Reader isn't great for non-Kindle books, and they don't carry many competing products on the app store), but I'm very happy with it.</p>",
